                            illustrations depicting key episodes of the tale.</summary>
                        <textLang mainLang="ja">Japanese</textLang>
                        <msItem>
                            <title xml:lang="ja">あをは物語</title>
                            <title xml:lang="ja-Latn">Aoba Monogatari</title>
